9. Padmabai Patidar (PW-1) deposed before the below tribunal that on 16.5.2011 at about 8.00 p.m.
while her husband Mukesh Patiedar was coming on his motorcycle from Kasrawad to Balsamud,
when he reached near Arihant Nagar, at that time driver of Maruti Van bearing registration No.MP12-B-1372 came there rashly and negligently by wrong side and hit the motorcycle driven by her husband Mukesh, due to which Mukesh sustained serious injuries over the head and other parts of the body.
